 C. (<year>2004</year>) <source>Mol. Biochem. Parasitol.</source> <volume>138</volume> <fpage>67</fpage>&#x02013;77<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15500917</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="ref34"><label>34</label><citation citation-type="journal">Hall, B. S., Smith, E., Langer, W., Jacobs, L. A., Goulding, D., and Field, M. C. (<year>2005</year>) <source>Eukaryot. Cell</source> <volume>4</volume> <fpage>971</fpage>&#x02013;980<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15879531</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="ref35"><label>35</label><citation citation-type="journal">Garcia-Salcedo, J. A., Perez-Morga, D., Gijon, P., Dilbeck, V., Pays, E., and Nolan, D. P. (<year>2004</year>) <source>EMBO J.</source> <volume>23</volume> <fpage>780</fpage>&#x02013;789<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14963487</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="ref36"><label>36</label><citation citation-type="journal">Allen, C. L., Goulding, D., and Field, M. C. (<year>2003</year>) <source>EMBO J.</source> <volume>22</volume> <fpage>4991</fpage>&#x02013;5002<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14517238</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="ref37"><label>37</label><citation citation-type="journal">Brickman, M. J., and Balber, A. E. (<year>1994</year>) <source>J. Cell Sci.</source> <volume>107</volume> <fpage>3191</fpage>&#x02013;3200<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7699016</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="ref38"><label>38</label><citation citation-type="journal">Kelley, R. J., Brickman, M. J., and Balber, A. E. (<year>1995</year>) <source>Mol. Biochem. Parasitol.</source> <volume>74</volume> <fpage>167</fpage>&#x02013;178<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8719158</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="ref39"><label>39</label><citation citation-type="journal">Triggs, V. P., and Bangs, J. D. (<year>2003</year>) <source>Eukaryot. Cell</source> <volume>2</volume> <fpage>76</fpage>&#x02013;83<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12582124</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="ref40"><label>40</label><citation citation-type="journal">Doyle, P. S., Zhou, Y. M., Engel, J. C., and McKe